1
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,900
Grandpa, I'm here.

2
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:43,300
You're just in time.

3
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:46,060
I read an ancient book last night

4
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:47,660
and found a prescription

5
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:49,330
that might help you.

6
00:00:51,030 --> 00:00:52,460
Take one pill from this bottle

7
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,530
every day

8
00:00:53,630 --> 00:00:54,930
for seven days.

9
00:00:55,230 --> 00:00:56,360
No more,

10
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:57,730
no less.

11
00:00:58,230 --> 00:00:59,160
Got it?

12
00:01:00,130 --> 00:01:00,960
Got it.

13
00:01:05,930 --> 00:01:06,700
Grandpa,

14
00:01:07,230 --> 00:01:09,300
you said there's power in my body.

15
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:11,160
What kind of power is it?

16
00:01:11,530 --> 00:01:12,860
Why is it sealed?

17
00:01:17,230 --> 00:01:18,030
Girl,

18
00:01:18,660 --> 00:01:21,960
having some power sealed
isn't necessarily a bad thing.

19
00:01:22,630 --> 00:01:24,260
When you're ready,

20
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:26,100
it will naturally appear.

21
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:27,830
Until then,

22
00:01:28,330 --> 00:01:29,530
just live well.

23
00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:47,430
That Poison-Repelling Bead is

24
00:01:47,530 --> 00:01:50,190
the Grandmaster's most
treasured possession.

25
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:57,560
What do you think he would do

26
00:01:58,330 --> 00:01:59,330
if he lost it?

27
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:10,560
Little snake,

28
00:02:10,830 --> 00:02:12,100
let me give you a name.

29
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:13,630
Let's call you

30
00:02:14,630 --> 00:02:15,300
Chilian.

31
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:16,460
How about that?

32
00:02:28,260 --> 00:02:29,060
Grandmaster,

33
00:02:29,300 --> 00:02:31,960
we found a rare herb in the back garden

34
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,360
but can't identify it.

35
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:34,600
Could you take a look?

36
00:02:38,230 --> 00:02:40,400
Girl, wait here for a moment.

37
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,800
I'll be right back.

38
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,200
Okay, Grandpa.

39
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:11,730
Huh,

40
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:12,800
what's this?

41
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,660
What a beautiful bead.

42
00:03:22,660 --> 00:03:23,700
Found it.

43
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:24,430
How dare you

44
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:27,400
steal the Grandmaster's
Poison-Repelling Bead!

45
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:29,400
Steal?

46
00:03:29,900 --> 00:03:31,500
I just saw it here

47
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:32,300
and picked it up to look at it.

48
00:03:32,300 --> 00:03:33,560
Still trying to argue?

49
00:03:33,660 --> 00:03:35,900
The Poison-Repelling Bead is
the Grandmaster's most precious treasure.

50
00:03:35,900 --> 00:03:37,100
He never takes it off.

51
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:38,500
You're an outsider.

52
00:03:38,660 --> 00:03:40,300
If you didn't intend to steal it,

53
00:03:40,300 --> 00:03:41,960
how did it end up in your hands?

54
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:46,100
I just picked it up to look at it.

55
00:03:46,700 --> 00:03:48,560
I had no intention of stealing it.

56
00:03:50,030 --> 00:03:52,500
These two have been

57
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:54,560
looking at me weirdly from the start.

58
00:03:54,630 --> 00:03:55,960
Is this on purpose?

59
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,560
What happened?

60
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:04,730
Grandmaster,

61
00:04:04,730 --> 00:04:06,800
this woman stole your
Poison-Repelling Bead.

62
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,260
We saw it with our own eyes.

63
00:04:08,300 --> 00:04:10,030
Yes, we saw it with our own eyes.

64
00:04:19,430 --> 00:04:21,230
Grandpa, I didn't steal it.

65
00:04:21,630 --> 00:04:23,660
I just saw this bead was beautiful

66
00:04:23,900 --> 00:04:25,430
and picked it up to look at it.

67
00:04:25,430 --> 00:04:26,360
Believe it

68
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,360
or not,

69
00:04:27,430 --> 00:04:28,960
I'm just telling the truth.

70
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:36,630
The look in this girl's eyes
doesn't seem like she's lying.

71
00:04:36,700 --> 00:04:38,230
What are you arguing about?

72
00:04:43,830 --> 00:04:45,830
Oh no, why is the Sect Leader here?

73
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,730
Did he hear what we just said?

74
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,030
Probably not.

75
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:52,960
As long as we insist she stole it.

76
00:04:52,960 --> 00:04:54,090
As long as we insist.

77
00:04:55,330 --> 00:04:56,430
I see.

78
00:04:57,159 --> 00:04:59,159
You set this up yourselves.

79
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,800
You said

80
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:03,930
she stole the Poison-Repelling Bead.

81
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,160
Yes,

82
00:05:05,330 --> 00:05:07,390
we saw her pick it up with our own eyes.

83
00:05:09,130 --> 00:05:10,330
Did she put it back

84
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,730
after picking it up?

85
00:05:16,060 --> 00:05:18,000
She did.

86
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:20,990
But she definitely wanted to steal it.

87
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:28,560
Then do you know the Poison-Repelling
Pearl has a special property?

88
00:05:29,130 --> 00:05:30,060
What property?

89
00:05:34,730 --> 00:05:36,700
The Poison-Repelling Pearl is forged
from Nine Heavens Black Iron

90
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:38,460
and Millennium Cold Jade.

91
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:40,130
It is extremely Yin and cold.

92
00:05:40,130 --> 00:05:42,100
Anyone who touches it
for more than three breaths

93
00:05:42,100 --> 00:05:44,300
will get red frostbite marks
on their palms.

94
00:05:44,300 --> 00:05:45,100
Ah.

95
00:05:50,860 --> 00:05:52,720
Kong has no red marks on her hands.

96
00:05:53,130 --> 00:05:54,400
Instead,

97
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,260
it is your hands that are trembling.
